This is the release of tfkiss-1.2.5, a port of TheFirmware by
NORD><LINK, originally written for TNC2 hardware. Refer to the
copyrght.txt and alas.* files in the doc directory for detailed
copyright information.

tfkiss-1.2.5 supports NetBSD, DragonFly BSD, Linux, and Solaris.
This release adds full 64-bit correctness, modernizes all function
definitions to ANSI C, and fixes a struct size mismatch on 64-bit
platforms. DESTDIR staged install support from the NetBSD pkgsrc
patches is also incorporated. Refer to the CHANGES file for detailed
information.

The source code for tfkiss-1.2.5 can be found at:
https://github.com/kq6up/tfkiss

Please send bug reports or comments to christopher.maness@gmail.com

Enjoy

73 de Chris
KQ6UP
